1792498191671_0.0431894212710251"}}},"time":{"created":"2026-05-18T07:06:46.501Z","modified":"2026-10-20T12:09:53.545Z","1.0.0-alpha.0":"2026-05-18T07:06:47.033Z","1.0.0":"2026-05-22T03:26:59.096Z","1.1.0":"2026-05-27T12:35:28.714Z","1.2.0":"2026-05-29T12:05:28.195Z","1.2.1":"2026-05-29T13:34:38.588Z","1.2.2":"2026-05-29T18:20:24.642Z","1.2.3":"2026-05-29T20:13:18.154Z","1.2.4":"2026-05-29T20:45:58.922Z","1.2.5":"2026-05-29T20:47:20.600Z","1.2.6":"2026-05-29T21:42:33.281Z","1.2.7":"2026-05-29T22:34:50.173Z","1.2.8":"2026-05-29T22:46:45.261Z","1.2.9":"2026-05-29T23:20:02.750Z","1.3.0":"2026-06-02T07:31:58.652Z","1.4.0":"2026-06-08T09:42:41.710Z","1.4.1":"2026-06-08T11:50:46.435Z","1.5.0":"2026-06-22T05:18:18.555Z","1.5.1":"2026-06-24T11:51:06.771Z","1.6.0":"2026-07-14T10:10:21.574Z","1.6.1":"2026-07-15T09:07:00.935Z","1.6.2":"2026-07-20T08:54:26.833Z","1.7.0":"2026-07-21T08:02:20.209Z","1.7.1":"2026-07-21T08:40:18.985Z","1.7.2":"2026-07-21T08:50:18.429Z","1.8.0":"2026-07-28T10:00:10.604Z","1.8.1":"2026-07-31T03:48:47.609Z","1.9.0":"2026-10-09T03:14:27.830Z","1.10.0":"2026-10-19T05:00:43.038Z","1.11.0":"2026-10-20T12:09:51.903Z"},"bugs":{"url":"https://github.com/manycoretech/aholo-viewer/issues"},"author":{"name":"egs"},"license":"MIT","homepage":"https://github.com/manycoretech/aholo-viewer#readme","keywords":["aholo","renderer","viewer","webgl","webgl2","3d","3d-gaussian-splatting","gaussian-splatting","canvas","html5"],"repository":{"url":"git+https://github.com/manycoretech/aholo-viewer.git","type":"git","directory":"packages/renderer"},"description":"A compact TypeScript renderer core used by the Aholo Viewer website and examples.","maintainers":[{"name":"yuck","email":"zx597813039@gmail.com"},{"name":"zhongli","email":"littlecold2333@gmail.com"},{"name":"manycore_root","email":"manycore@qunhemail.com"},{"name":"m2mbob","email":"2844870322@qq.com"},{"name":"daief","email":"defeng_mail@163.com"},{"name":"skylar124","email":"shencaiyiyi11@gmail.com"},{"name":"xuan_zang","email":"xuanzang@qunhemail.com"},{"name":"manycore_admin","email":"feinfra@qunhemail.com"}],"readme":"# @manycore/aholo-viewer\n\n`@manycore/aholo-viewer` is the full-featured npm package for building browser-based Aholo Viewer applications. It includes the rendering runtime and TypeScript declarations for rendering 3D Gaussian Splatting (3DGS) and mesh content in WebGL/WebGL2-capable browsers.\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\nnpm install --save @manycore/aholo-viewer\n```\n\nThe package is ESM-only and ships TypeScript declarations through `dist/index.d.ts`.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nFollow the [Getting Started guide](https://aholojs.dev/en-US/manual/getting-started/) to create a Vite app, initialize a viewer, load a 3DGS splat, and render the first frame.\n\n## Splatting Configuration\n\nConfigure offscreen composition and tone mapping through `pipeline.Splatting.composite`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { setViewerConfig, ToneMapping } from '@manycore/aholo-viewer';\n\nsetViewerConfig(viewer, {\n    pipeline: {\n        Splatting: {\n            enabled: true,\n            composite: {\n                enabled: true,\n                highPrecisionEnabled: true,\n                toneMapping: ToneMapping.Neutral,\n                exposure: 1,\n            },\n        },\n    },\n});\n```\n\nWhen upgrading, move the former `Splatting.toneMapping` fields into `Splatting.composite` and remove `pack.sortedLayoutEnabled`. Set `composite.highPrecisionEnabled: true` to retain the floating-point intermediate buffer previously enabled by tone mapping. See the [configuration migration guide](https://aholojs.dev/en-US/manual/config/) and [changelog](./CHANGELOG.md) for details.\n\nFor chunk LOD, `SplatUtils.LodConfig.pixelLimitEnabled` defaults to `true`. Set it to `false` to allow refinement beyond the viewport-based sampling limit while retaining the level and point-budget constraints.\n\n## Documentation\n\n- Website: https://aholojs.dev/\n- Getting Started: https://aholojs.dev/en-US/manual/getting-started/\n- API Reference: https://aholojs.dev/en-US/api/\n- Examples: https://aholojs.dev/en-US/examples/\n- AI-friendly docs: https://aholojs.dev/llms.txt\n- AI coding skill: https://github.com/manycoretech/aholo-viewer/blob/master/docs/ai/skills/use-aholo-viewer/SKILL.md\n\n## License\n\nMIT\n","readmeFilename":"README.md"}